  "_notes": [
    "Overlaps with wholesale_foodstuffs_dry (wholesale template) and",
    "staple_foods (kiosk template) — deliberately kept as a separate,",
    "deeper template rather than merged, since a dedicated cereals/grains",
    "shop goes far deeper on this one category group than a kiosk or",
    "general wholesaler would. Perishability tracking (Build Plan v3,",
    "Phase 11) is directly relevant here — grains are inorganic/expiry-",
    "dated in the sense of shelf life, not organic spoilage — flagging the",
    "connection, not building it here.",
    "Sold both loose (by weight, gorogoro) and pre-packaged — both unit",
    "styles included.",
    "July 2026 decision: animal feed / feed by-products do NOT belong in this template -- they're an agrovet concern, and 'agrovet' is not yet one of the 9 first-cohort business types. 'Bran/animal feed by-product' was removed from flour_milled_products accordingly. Adding agrovet as a business type (with its own feed/veterinary/seed categories) is future Phase 8 scope, not started."
